#. +> trunk
#: resourceakonadiconfig.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>By default you will be asked where to put a new Contact or Distribution List when you create them.</para>"
"<para>For convenience it is also possible to configure a default folder for each of the two data items.</para>"
"<para><note>If the folder list below is empty, you might have to add an address book source through <interface>%1</interface></note></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Standardwies warrst Du bi't Opstellen vun nieg Kontakten un Verdeellisten fraagt, woneem Du de wohren wullt.</para>"
"<para>Du kannst ok en Standardorner för elkeen vun disse Datenobjekten fastleggen.</para>"
"<para><note>Is de Orner nerrn leddig, muttst Du wull över <interface>%1</interface> en Adressbook-Born tofögen.</note></para>"

#. +> trunk
